OL,3,AUS Defence Secretary Hegseth to address
OL,4,Areporters after Republican begins
OL,5,Aimpeachment effort
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth is
OL,8,Fset to hold a news conference from the
OL,9,FPentagon after a Republican congressman
OL,10,Flaunched an attempt to impeach him -
OL,11,Fwatch live from 08:00 EST (13:00 GMT)
OL,13,FIt will be Hegseth's first news
OL,14,Fconference in six months, and comes
OL,15,Famid mounting frustration from both
OL,16,Fparties over his handling of the Iran
OL,17,Fwar
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
