OL,3,AUS Defence Secretary Hegseth to address
OL,4,Areporters after Republican begins
OL,5,Aimpeachment effort
OL,6,
OL,7,FArticles of impeachment were introduced
OL,8,Finto the House of Representatives on
OL,9,FMonday by Republican Thomas Massie, who
OL,10,Fsays the defence secretary violated the
OL,11,Fconstitution by not seeking approval
OL,12,Ffor the war
OL,14,FHegseth has said he is "not worried"
OL,15,Fabout the impeachment effort and told
OL,16,Freporters to come "loaded" with
OL,17,Fquestions
OL,19,FThe effort will likely fail, as
OL,20,FRepublicans remain in power in Congress
OL,21,Funtil January, meaning they have the
OL,22,Fmajority power over any vote
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
